    description: Some("One to eight players pick corporate sponsors and compete across four events — footbag juggling, half-pipe skateboarding, BMX racing and surfing — chasing ribbons in each event and the best overall score. Timing carries everything, from pumping the half-pipe for air to kick combinations that double and triple a footbag run, and a burst of Louie Louie closes out each event."),
